  "description": "Thinking of turning off the computer, asking your friends to feed the goldfish, and heading off for a few weeks? Our Arise Tour is ready when the wanderlust hits you. Based on our incredibly adaptable, double butted steel frameset, we have added Tubus touring racks, aluminium fenders, and a full lighting system from KT and Supernova. Transmission on a long distance tour must be dependable, so Microshift’s ultra reliable bar end shifters, 10 speed clutch mech, 11 – 42T wide ratio cassette running on a subcompact 46 / 30 chainset is the perfect setup. Braking is taken care of with TRP Spyre C mechanical callipers paired with a 180 mm rotor upfront to control your speed on those long descents. Great care has been taken to select all proven and reliable features, so you can focus on riding, not fixing your bike.\n\nWTB ST i19 double wall, TCS 2.0, 32h\n\nWTB ST i19 double wall, TCS 2.0, 32h",
